id           = CWE-1073
name         = Non-SQL Invokable Control Element with Excessive Number of Data Resource Accesses
abstraction  = Base
structure    = Simple
status       = Incomplete

description : The product contains a client with a function or method that contains a large number of data accesses/queries that are sent through a data manager, i.e., does not use efficient database capabilities.

extended description : While the interpretation of "large number of data accesses/queries" may vary for each product or developer, CISQ recommends a default maximum of 2 data accesses per function/method.

notes : https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/1073.html
